  "body_text": "Accelerate Breeding Programs with Genomic Tools\nGenomic Selection\n        LDgenX develops genomic tools that enable the integration of genetic information into breeding programs, supporting more accurate and efficient selection decisions.\n            Approaches\n        Technologies\nWhole-Genome Sequencing (WGS)\nCustom SNP PanelsAquaculture\nGrowth performance\nDisease resistance\nRobustnessAgriculture\nMarker-assisted selection\nVariety development\n    \n            Services\n        12345678910\n            Case study\n        \n                The European Sea bass\n            \n            Developpement of a SNPs panel\n\nLet’s discuss your project\n        \n        Do you wish to implement biodiversity monitoring, study a population, or develop a specific molecular tool ?\n    \n                Contact our team",
